#: src/getting-started.md:1
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started.md:3
msgid ""
"Welcome to Zed! We are excited to have you. Zed is a powerful multiplayer "
"code editor designed to stay out of your way and help you build what's next."
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started.md:5
msgid ""
"This guide gets you from zero to productive in Zed. You'll learn the "
"essential commands, configure your environment, and find your way around."
msgstr ""

