msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started.md:34
msgid ""
"Open the Settings Editor with `Cmd+,` (macOS) or `Ctrl+,` (Linux/Windows). "
"Search for any setting and change it directly."
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started.md:36
msgid "Common first changes:"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started.md:38
msgid ""
"**Theme**: Press `Cmd+K Cmd+T` (macOS) or `Ctrl+K Ctrl+T` (Linux/Windows) to "
"open the theme selector"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started.md:39
msgid "**Font**: Search for `buffer_font_family` in Settings"
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started.md:40
msgid "**Format on save**: Search for `format_on_save` and set to `on`"
msgstr ""

