"`Cmd+Enter` (macOS) / `Ctrl+Enter` (Linux/Windows) for inline assistance."
msgstr ""

#: src/getting-started.md:56
msgid ""
"See [AI Overview](./ai/overview.md) to configure providers and learn what's "
"possible."
msgstr ""

